
---

### 5️⃣ `.gitignore`
Create this file in the root directory to prevent cache files from being uploaded.

```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / cache files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/

# IDE / editor folders
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db